{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#card-zh","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-switch 是面向 DSH Web 的插件管理扩展，在设置中的插件清单提供交互式管理界面。它通过 DSH loader 与 Web 服务接入，在浏览器中列出插件状态，并支持逐项启用或停用、按名称或状态排序、分组筛选和搜索。用户还可对当前结果批量操作，并在切换前备份、之后撤销；适合希望直接从 DSH 页面管理插件的 Web profile 使用者。需要 DSH web profile；状态保存在 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:271-300","client.js:391-420","index.js:764-781"]}
{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#card-en","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"plugin-switch adds a DSH Web plugin panel for listing, searching, filtering and sorting plugins. Users can toggle entries individually or in bulk, then undo changes from saved backups. It requires the Web profile and stores state in cordis.patch.yml.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:271-300","client.js:391-420","index.js:764-781"]}
