{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#feature-1","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-switch 的功能「状态筛选与搜索」：在插件清单按名称搜索，并筛选全部、已启用、已停用或运行失败的条目；结果也可按名称或启用状态排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:391-405"]}
