{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#feature-3","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-switch 的功能「批量启停」：对当前搜索和筛选结果批量启用或停用插件，操作前显示确认并跳过关键条目；批量变更使用一次备份。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:407-424"]}
{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#feature-4","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-switch 的功能「撤销与备份」：点击撤销可恢复切换前的配置；服务端自动保存补丁文件备份，并轮换保留最近 20 份。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:371-388"]}
{"unit_id":"cynch18__plugin-switch#caveat-1","repo":"cynch18/plugin-switch","commit":"3f13f7a7e1c995f38e80f1af8c206ff7bb749329","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"plugin-switch 使用前须知：撤销会用切换前保存的 cordis.patch.yml 备份覆盖当前文件，因此备份之后的手动修改也会被覆盖。（见 index.js:674-702）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:674-702"]}
